  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): マツバボタン",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%84%E3%83%90%E3%83%9C%E3%82%BF%E3%83%B3",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 107594817,
      "text": "マツバボタン はスベリヒユ科スベリヒユ属の一年生草本。別名ホロビンソウ、ツメキリソウ、ヒデリソウ。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Portulaca grandiflora",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_grandiflora",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1345227626,
      "text": "Portulaca grandiflora is a succulent flowering plant in the purslane family Portulacaceae, native to southern Brazil, Argentina, and Uruguay and often cultivated in gardens. It has many common names, including rose moss, eleven o'clock, Mexican rose, moss rose, sun rose, rose Jepun, table rose, rock rose, and moss-rose purslane. Despite these names and the superficial resemblance of some cultivars' flowers to roses, it is not a true rose, nor even a part of the rose family or rosid group; rather, it is much more closely related to carnations and cacti."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Portulaca grandiflora",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_grandiflora",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 174152666,
      "text": "Portulaca grandiflora, conocida como mañanitas, amor de un rato, flor de seda, bella a las once o verdolaga de flor y once horas es una planta anual suculenta de la familia Portulacaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Portulaca grandiflora",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_grandiflora",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 203242531,
      "text": "Le chevalier-d'onze-heures ou pourpier à grandes fleurs (Portulaca grandiflora) est une plante herbacée de la famille des portulacacées. Elle est indigène en Argentine, au Brésil du sud et en Uruguay. Elle est utilisée comme plante ornementale."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Onze-horas",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Onze-horas",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 62996026,
      "text": "Onze-horas é uma planta da família Portulacaceae, nativa da América do Sul, ocorrendo desde o sudeste brasileiro até o Uruguai e a Argentina. Também pode ser encontrada no sul do continente asiático. Em Bangladesh é conhecida como “Time Fool”, por causa de sua floração ocorrer de acordo com o tempo, quase sempre próximo ao meio-dia."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Krokot mawar",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krokot_mawar",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28435701,
      "text": "Krokot mawar  atau rose moss adalah tanaman hias yang tergolong familia Portulacaceae yang berasal dari Amerika Selatan. Tanaman ini disebut juga bunga pukul sembilan karena umumnya bunga mekar pada pukul sembilan pagi. Penamaan ilmiah terdiri dari portulaca, berarti gerbang yang merujuk kepada kapsul benih yang membuka seperti gerbang, dan grandiflora, berarti bunga yang besar. Portulaca adalah tanaman sukulen yang menyukai sinar matahari dan bunganya menguncup pada malam hari atau saat mendung."
    }
